1.Install Flutter and Dart SDK on your system, create a new Flutter project named insta_clone, and run it to display the default counter app in your 
emulator or physical device.

  1.  Install the Flutter SDK from the official Flutter website.

  2.  Install Android Studio and an Android emulator, or connect an Android phone with USB debugging enabled.

  3.  Add Flutter to your system PATH.

  4.Run:
    flutter doctor

Create the project:--
    flutter create insta_clone
    cd insta_clone
    flutter run
